//! The `stroke-dasharray` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property defines a
//! pattern of dashes and gaps used in the painting of the
//! [SVG](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/SVG) shape's stroke. If present, it overrides
//! the element's `stroke-dasharray` attribute.
//!
//! Initial: none. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: refer to the normalized diagonal measure of the current SVG viewport's applied
//! `viewBox`, or of the viewport itself if no viewBox is specified.
//!
//! Grammar: none | [<length-percentage> | <number>]+#
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/fill-stroke-3/#propdef-stroke-dasharray
//!
//! Author guide:
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/stroke-dasharray
//!
//! Purpose and value descriptions adapted from MDN contributors (CC-BY-SA-2.5).
//!
//! Generated from @webref/css 8.7.8. Do not edit.

